                0.155
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "assumptions are provided by the Macro-Budgetary Forecasting and Steering Unit (CPPMB), in line with their budget documents, ensuring a clear and institutionally grounded data flow for the annual debt projection cycle. Debt stock data and interest payment figures are compiled by the Directorate of Public Debt, which also coordinates the consolidation of inputs across agencies.",
