                0.238
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Third, to preserve and transmit the analytical capacity built during the project, the authorities developed user manuals for the DDT, the Natural Disaster DDT, and the commodity price shock tool. Experienced staff are committed to using these manuals to train new technical team members at least twice a year, ensuring continuity as the Directorate of Public Debt and the CPPMB deepen their public debt management capacity.",
